## Notes

- `just quality-test-rust-unit` runs workspace library tests.
- `just quality-test-rust-integration` runs workspace integration tests.
- `just quality-test-frontend` runs the frontend unit test suite.
- `just quality-smoke` runs the CLI, Playwright web, and PTY-driven Ratatui smoke tests.
- `just quality-smoke-dev-stack` boots the same Docker Compose stack as `just up`, checks the frontend proxy path, triggers a real workflow run, and waits for success.

